# Personal or machine-local strings. Warn. Do not block.
# One extended regex per line. Lines that start with # are comments.
# Personal strings (your own emails, hostnames) do not belong in this tracked file.
# Keep them in an untracked local list instead.

/Users/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+
/home/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+
192\.168\.\d{1,3}\.\d{1,3}
~/\.ssh/
~/\.cursor/
